## Navigation Contract

Four things must stay in sync when a block has a full-page view. If any one is missing, something breaks silently.

| Thing | File | What to do |
|---|---|---|
| `PageType` | `src/stores/types.ts` | Add the route string to the union type |
| `pageRoute` | `src/lib/block-registry.ts` | Set to the same `PageType` string |
| `validOnboardPages` | `src/app/page.tsx` | Add the route string so `?onboard=` deep-links work |
| Shell route case | `src/components/app/CandidateShell.tsx` | Add an `if (currentPage === '...')` that renders the block component |
| `BLOCK_TO_SLOT` | `src/components/employer/CareerCardModal.tsx` | Map block ID → CareerCard action slot (if `employerRequestable`) |

### Rules

- **`pageRoute` on the registry MUST match a `PageType` value.** They are the same string.
- **`validOnboardPages` MUST include every `pageRoute` that exists.** Otherwise invite → onboard → deep-link silently fails.
- **`CandidateShell` MUST have a route case for every `pageRoute`.** Otherwise `setCurrentPage('xyz')` renders nothing.
- **When removing a block**, reverse all four: drop the `PageType` (if no other block uses it), remove from `validOnboardPages`, remove the shell case, remove from `BLOCK_TO_SLOT`.

