## File Size Limits

| File type | Soft limit | Hard limit |
|---|---|---|
| `page.tsx` | 300 lines | 500 lines |
| Feature component | 300 lines | 600 lines |
| Shell component | 150 lines | 300 lines |
| Store file | 150 lines | 300 lines |

If a file approaches its hard limit, split it.

