## Adding a New Feature

### Candidate feature (most common)

1. Follow the block development checklist in `.cursor/rules/block-development.mdc`
2. Create block component in `src/components/blocks/[BlockName]Block.tsx`
3. Register in block registry, wire in `CandidateShell`, add data tables if needed

### Employer feature

1. Create `src/components/employer/[FeatureName].tsx`
2. Add routing case in `EmployerShell`
3. Register page in `src/stores/types.ts` → `PageType`
4. Wrap in `<ErrorBoundary section="Feature Name">`
